      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RUGGED ETHICS (5) pinged the lids and was in the firing line early but drifted out of it when 8th at Wentworth Park in Grade 4/5 company. Has never been out of the money in five starts this course and distance. Tough to beat if on-song. MAGIC SCOTCH (1) has missed the frame at her last couple but wasn't beaten far three back when third (30.60) at Wentworth Park in a Grade 5. This looks easier and expected to improve sharply. MAGIC SNOWDROP (4) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing eighth (36.50) last time in a Grade 5 at Richmond. Key runner who gets her chance to atone. SUPER SASSY (2) generally performs well over this distance.",
